e:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>作为国内顶级的徒步圣地，雨崩适合安排</span><span>4</span><span>-</span><span>5</span><span>天的行程，四季都有其独特的风景。徒步难度不算很大，配套也较为完善，算是初级的徒步路线，体力较好的年轻人基本都能完成。也可以安排连同丽江、香格里拉一起游玩7-10天，日照金山、高原风光、古镇闲暇，全能一并领略。</span></p><img data-key=\"1\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3847-audiofreehighqps/79/9B/GKwRIJIMixYaAAjXzwQFuY8A.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3847-audiofreehighqps/79/9B/GKwRIJIMixYaAAjXzwQFuY8A.png?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3847-audiofreehighqps/79/9B/GKwRIJIMixYaAAjXzwQFuY8A.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"661.6412806963009\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3847-audiofreehighqps/79/9B/GKwRIJIMixYaAAjXzwQFuY8A.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"123.50637239664285\"><br><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\"><span><b>路线</b></span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\"><span><b>介绍</b></span></p><span></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><b>·</b></span><span><b>神瀑（难度最小）</b></span><span>：神瀑位于卡瓦格博峰南侧，是藏民转山朝圣的必到之处。瀑布从悬岩倾泻而下，景色随季节变化：夏季水量充沛，颇为壮观；冬季则如千丝万缕的哈达。神瀑也是最具人文性的线路，原始森林里随处点缀着彩色的藏族经幡和玛尼石堆，早早去神瀑祈福洗礼的藏民们会微笑鼓励每一位正面朝雪山奋力前行的徒步者。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><b>·</b></span><span><b>冰湖（难度中等）</b>：</span><span>冰湖海拔约3800米，是梅里雪山冰川融水汇集形成的深绿色海子（湖泊），被当地人视为圣湖。湖水清澈碧绿，周边是雪山、冰川和草甸，景色壮丽宛如世界的尽头。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><b>·神湖（难度最高）</b>：</span><span>神湖海拔4400米，几乎一路都在爬升，且为非开发路线，野路为主，挑战神湖线建议结伴而行或请个向导随行。一路原始森林、高山草甸，作为高山冰蚀湖的神湖静谧地躺在雪山环抱之中，同时你可以几乎近距离欣赏梅里雪山最美丽的山峰——神女峰。</span></p><img data-key=\"2\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/2493-audiofreehighqps/11/F5/GKwRIaIMixY4ACAFIwQFuaSl.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/2493-audiofreehighqps/11/F5/GKwRIaIMixY4ACAFIwQFuaSl.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/2493-audiofreehighqps/11/F5/GKwRIaIMixY4ACAFIwQFuaSl.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"562.5\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/2493-audiofreehighqps/11/F5/GKwRIaIMixY4ACAFIwQFuaSl.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"105\"><br><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>（</span><span>神</span><span>瀑</span><span>沿途</span><span>的</span><span>自然</span><span>+</span><span>人文</span><span>风光</span><span>，</span><span>是我</span><span>最</span><span>喜欢</span><span>的</span><span>一</span><span>条线</span><span>，</span><span>又</span><span>轻松</span><span>又</span><span>美</span><span>又</span><span>丰富</span><span>）</span></p><img data-key=\"3\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/501f-audiofreehighqps/51/9A/GKwRIaIMixZFAAgzrAQFua2a.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/501f-audiofreehighqps/51/9A/GKwRIaIMixZFAAgzrAQFua2a.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/501f-audiofreehighqps/51/9A/GKwRIaIMixZFAAgzrAQFua2a.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"422.6736566186108\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/501f-audiofreehighqps/51/9A/GKwRIaIMixZFAAgzrAQFua2a.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"78.89908256880734\"><br><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>（冰湖</span><span>，</span><span>下到</span><span>湖边去</span><span>更像</span><span>世界</span><span>的</span><span>尽头</span><span>了</span><span>）</span></p><span></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>雨崩在不同季节有不同风貌：</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>5-6月：杜鹃花盛开，漫山遍野，草木葱郁，气温回暖，是徒步的好季节。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>7-8月：夏季，雨水较多，绿意最浓，是采摘松茸的季节。神瀑水量较大。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>9-10月：秋季，天气晴朗，秋色宜人，山林色彩斑斓，是徒步、摄影和转山的最佳时节。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>10月底-次年5月：冬季，部分路段可能因积雪难以通行，但雪景极为壮美，神瀑会变成飘洒的冰瀑。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><b>【联系我们】</b></span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>欢迎喜欢旅行、即将旅行的朋友们加入听友群；</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>欢迎对某个目的地或路线的游玩非常有见解的听友自荐成为节目嘉宾。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>联系我可加<b>微信：mozoey</b>（请备注来意）</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>也欢迎关注我的<b>小红书：木子要浪游</b></span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>如果对本期嘉宾Gap有</span><span>问题</span><span>咨询</span><span>或是</span><span>需要</span><span>户外</span><span>领队</span><span>相关</span><span>服务</span><span>的</span><span>欢迎</span><span>关注</span><span><b>Gap的小红书</b></span><span><b>：</b></span><span><b>G</b></span><span><b>a</b></span><span><b>p</b></span><span><b>y</b></span><span><b>e</b></span><span><b>a</b></span><span><b>r</b></span><span><b>(</b></span><span><b>小红书</b></span><span><b>号</b></span><span><b>：</b></span><span><b>9</b></span><span><b>5</b></span><span><b>4</b></span><span><b>0</b></span><span><b>2</b></span><span><b>6</b></span><span